---
title: kube-state-metrics
---
kube-state-metrics exposes the state of pods, nodes and workloads (restarts,
last termination reason, readiness, resource requests and limits) in
Prometheus format. Scrapers sharing its namespace reach it at
`kube-state-metrics:8080`; from another namespace use
`kube-state-metrics.<namespace>.svc.cluster.local:8080`.

Read what it exports:

  kubectl -n observability port-forward svc/kube-state-metrics 8080
  curl -s localhost:8080/metrics | grep kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total
